    "summary": "Artefact, ?skeuomorph, ?sheath for dagger, sword or knife; lost-wax cast in brass. Decorated on front and back surfaces with horizontal plaitwork. Front surface has three snakes running length of artefact; two outer snakes bite human heads at top. Central snake terminates below standing male figure wearing beaded ornaments and holding staff in right hand and ada sword in left. Top of artefact terminates in toothed projections and interlaced bosses; four holes at front. Base of artefact decorated with human head. Loose element, pebble or rattle inside artefact.",
